<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>7 - George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>6 - Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza),</p>
<p>Marcello Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>4 - Abel Balbo (Roma), Enrico Chiesa (Parma), Sandro Tovalieri</p>
<p>(Reggiana)</p>
<p>3 - Roberto Baggio and Marco Simone (both Milan), Gabriel</p>
<p>Batistuta (Fiorentina), Oliver Bierhoff and Paolo Poggi (both</p>
<p>Udinese), Nicola Caccia (Napoli), Roberto Mancini (Sampdoria),</p>
<p>Marco Negri (Perugia), Carlo Nervo (Bologna), Michele Padovano</p>
<p>(Juventus)</p>
</text>
